## Master formula sheet
- **Price to Earnings (P/E) Ratio:** `P/E = Market Price per Share / Earnings per Share (EPS)` - Valuation multiple comparing stock price to net profitability.
- **Enterprise Value (EV):** `EV = Market Cap + Total Debt - Cash & Cash Equivalents` - Total theoretical acquisition cost of an entire firm.
- **EV / EBITDA:** `EV / EBITDA = Enterprise Value / EBITDA` - Capital structure-neutral operating valuation metric.

